jei.immersivenuclear.nuclear_engineering.info=Reinforced structure and couplings of the reactor systems. Recipe not defined yet.
jei.immersivenuclear.control_engineering.info=Relays and signal modules for the control and automation of the machines. Recipe not defined yet.
jei.immersivenuclear.radioactive_handling.info=Shielded chamber with viewport and grippers, for handling and transferring radioactive materials. Recipe not defined yet.
jei.immersivenuclear.computer_part.info=Part of the mod's computers, which are in development: no recipe and no use yet. Get it from the creative tab.
jei.immersivenuclear.precipitating_agent.info=Goes into the Precipitation Unit (future machine) to turn the uranium into a solid.
jei.immersivenuclear.wet_uranium_concentrate.info=Comes out of the Precipitation Unit (future machine) and goes to the Industrial Dryer.
jei.immersivenuclear.yellowcake.info=Final product of line 1: uranium concentrate, not enriched. Comes out of the Industrial Dryer (future machine).
jei.immersivenuclear.fluid_upcoming.info=Fluid of the next machines of the line (chemical separation, effluent treatment and drying). For now it can only be stored in tanks.
